      "definition": "As used in this division, \"revenue contributor\" means the state, the counties that are parties to the cooperative agreement, or any political subdivision or taxing unit located within any of those participating counties, that pledges revenue to a regional transportation improvement project under division (A) of this section.\n\nLast updated September 28, 2023 at 4:15 PM",
